44
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:57,520
 made it exceed the max number of 100 headers, including the internal headers added by CloudFlare,

45
00:02:57,520 --> 00:03:01,940
 then you'd be able to sneak those in and get your resource cached with the malicious HTTP

